msgstr "傳回對應的 :class:`Task` 物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio.rst:44
msgid ""
"Return the :class:`Task` object associated with the currently running task."
msgstr "傳回與目前執行中任務相關聯的 :class:`Task` 物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio.rst:48
msgid ""
"Create a new task from the given coroutine and run it until it completes."
msgstr "從給定的協程建立一個新任務並執行它直到完成。"

#: ../../library/asyncio.rst:50
msgid "Returns the value returned by *coro*."
msgstr "傳回 *coro* 所傳回的值。"

#: ../../library/asyncio.rst:54
msgid "Sleep for *t* seconds (can be a float)."
msgstr "休眠 *t* 秒（可以是浮點數）。"

